    "sections": {
        "description": "Bosa Finance Consult is a fast, lightweight WordPress theme for financial advisors, brokers, accountants, advertising agencies, business consultants, corporate firms, digital agencies, and finance companies sites, built for Elementor and WooCommerce. Launch your site visually - no code required. Built with SEO, speed, and usability in mind, Bosa Finance Consult supports custom headers, footers, and mega menus with Elementor, and includes a full starter site you can import in one click. Works seamlessly with Elementor and Gutenberg, and stays compatible with major plugins like WooCommerce, Yoast, Contact Form 7, and Mailchimp. Bosa Finance Consult also works with BEW, an Elementor addon offering widgets, templates, and AI-powered content generation."
    },
